1
00:00:00,803 --> 00:00:04,263
(Howard:)...the only wand that ever saw any action
was this one.

2
00:00:07,518 --> 00:00:12,358
Oh! Look what my mom
made us for the act.

3
00:00:15,902 --> 00:00:18,782
(Howard:)Well, she cut up
one of her old bathing suits.

4
00:00:21,616 --> 00:00:25,536
(Howard:)She made these two vests
and haIf a dozen napkins.

5
00:00:25,745 --> 00:00:28,745
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Has she tried on the vest yet?

6
00:00:29,374 --> 00:00:31,874
l just gave it to her.
- I hope it fits.

7
00:00:32,043 --> 00:00:36,753
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)She has a tricky figure.
She's short and stacked like me.

8
00:00:38,508 --> 00:00:42,508
(Howard:)She's not stacked like you, Ma.
She never steps on hers.

9
00:00:46,891 --> 00:00:50,431
(Bernadette:)Listen, Howie. Maybe I'm not the
best choice to be a magician's assistant.

10
00:00:50,645 --> 00:00:53,145
(Howard:)You'll do fine. Hand me those rings?

11
00:00:54,357 --> 00:00:56,487
(Howard:)See? You nailed it.

12
00:00:56,692 --> 00:00:59,732
No, it's just that I'm not
that comfortable with little kids.

